type: software
title: "Quicksort–Mallows: reproducible computations and interactive experiments"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24186089"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Andrianarivony
    given-names: Fidy Heritiana
repository-code: "https://github.com/Fidy-Heritiana/Quicksort-Mallows"
url: "https://github.com/Fidy-Heritiana/Quicksort-Mallows"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible numerical computations and interactive experiments for
  first-pivot Quicksort with stable partitioning under Mallows-distributed
  input. The repository includes finite-size means and centred moments,
  exact rational checks of identities, Monte Carlo simulations, saved
  manuscript data and figures, and interactive notebook and Streamlit
  interfaces. The experiments illustrate asymptotic moment behaviour and
  normal fluctuations for a fixed Mallows parameter between zero and one.
keywords:
  - Quicksort
  - Mallows permutations
  - analytic combinatorics
  - factorial moments
  - central limit theorem
